parameters.description:
Call a LINE MCP tool that has no dedicated tool here. Allowed tool names:
- create_rich_menu: build the Official Account rich menu and set it as default. argsJson = {"chatBarText":"Menu","actions":[{"type":"message","label":"Price","text":"price"}]} (1-6 actions; each is a LINE action object - message, uri or postback). The menu image is generated automatically.
- broadcast_text_message: argsJson = {"message":{"type":"text","text":"..."}}
- broadcast_flex_message: argsJson = {"message":{"type":"flex","altText":"...","contents":{"type":"bubble"}}}
Broadcasts go to EVERY follower and cannot be recalled; they are refused unless the workflow owner has enabled them. Never use this tool for ordinary messages - use send_line_text or send_line_flex. argsJson must be raw JSON, no markdown fence.
